{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_15_level_main_15-06_end",
  "groupId": "main_15",
  "stageId": "main_15-07",
  "title": "临界时刻",
  "storyCode": "15-7",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_15-06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "6265b700ae3d40b0942624a1dd7400ea85419114a91844cda243d2e5b4066ae2",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯从未觉得毁灭，尤其是能清晰感受到逼近的毁灭，是一件能够被坦然接受的事实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我，我做不到亲历所爱的一切被摧毁之后还能无动于衷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我无法理解您——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "并非无动于衷，而是相信宇宙的绝对平等。可惜，你来得稍晚了一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这艘舰船刚刚在数万光年外，目睹了一次超新星爆炸，并顺利逃离。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "若是你能亲眼见到那个景象，或许就更能理解我的意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大厅内的仪器开始快速地转动，直到卡特斯无法再用肉眼捕捉到它的轨迹。\n然后，她看到了许多浮动的光影出现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我看到了一个发射暗淡深红色光芒的巨大球体，而另一个靛蓝色的小点也在球体的表面飞速掠过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，又好像是那个很大的球体正绕着那个很小的蓝点旋转？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你口中的蓝点就是刚刚经历了超新星爆炸的脉冲星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个正逐渐被撕扯的红色恒星曾是它的同伴，如今也正走向不可逆转的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它们曾带来了许多有趣的原始生命，我也十分怀念在那个星系的行星中漫步的经历。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可惜那些生命甚至尚未来得及看到天空之外的世界就迎来了死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您为何要向我展示这些？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "只是在共享我们所拥有的知识，旅客。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "片面的偏执与无知往往是有效信息传递的障碍之一，我对你的来历同样无知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯已经无暇去理解眼前之人的话，猛然间她所触及的新知识开始冲击她的思维。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大地......可能会诞生两次生命？这些从天空坠下的星星......也会带来生命？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“毁灭”的尽头......并非绝望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们......于那片大地而言并不特殊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一颗足以供养生命的星球会平等地爱着所有生活其上的生物，无论生命发源于何处。这是自然的规律。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的精灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要过度贪婪地汲取那些你还无法完全理解的知识。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我在其中也看到了您的身影，您的身边也曾有许多同族，但突然——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“幽灵”，很多人这样称呼您，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我的确只是一个游荡的幽灵。如我所言，当真正的毁灭降临于我和我的同族面前时，我也无能为力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......您所说的毁灭到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已经在这里看到了太多分明是神明才能实现的手段，到底是怎样的毁灭才能威胁到你们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "旅客，你的问题，恐怕这艘船上无人能够回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪怕在你的眼中，我们所拥有的知识足以被寰宇中众多的生命视作“神明的手段”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但宇宙之浩瀚，我们所能探索的领域也同样存在极限。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你很失落？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以绝不可能存在一个永恒的国度，一个人人都能获得无尽幸福和快乐的乐园？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你希望这样的国度存在吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡特斯犹豫片刻后，点了点头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "没有生灵是永恒的。我所熟知的历史中，也有过传奇的文明征服了千万个星系，他们在宇宙中漫步的时光跨越百万年之久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可于宇宙而言，他们留下的痕迹终究还是渺小不堪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们都曾迷失在盲目追求不存在的信条与理想的......不可追忆的黄金时代中，我们都坚信自我的存在有着绝对的目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可最终呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "任何一个诞生灵智的生命都曾执着于宣扬自我为所处世界的中心，但是否有可能，对宇宙而言——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "自始至终，我们无足轻重。这才是了解宇宙之前所必须学会的第一课。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "记得你刚刚所见的那场绚丽的超新星爆发吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "生命终会在坟墓中再次诞生，而终有一天，他们会理解我们在墓碑上刻下的印记。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那是我们曾经拥有的生活。我们存在过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我无法理解您的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那我们是如何在那片大地上诞生的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我们之前，是否也曾诞生过更加辉煌的文明？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而我们是否也会在目所能及的未来迎接毁灭？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还有我更在意的，源石所带来的疾病与痛苦，是否也能得到根除？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我请求您指引我找到通往这些知识的道路......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我无法回答你任何一个问题。你的前三个问题在宇宙中有着不同语言的不同版本，它们只能由你们自身回答。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "而最后一个问题......很抱歉，我从未听说过“源石”，也并未从已有的资料库中搜索到任何与“源石”相关的信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不过，我认识一位有趣的人，也是这艘舰船的主人。或许她能解答你的疑惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "希尔达",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这艘舰船的主人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "幽灵",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也是一位声名远扬的语言学家，她叫——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“普瑞赛斯”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "博士，现在不是发呆的时候！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抓紧我！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "——！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "阿米娅，你看到了吗？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我暂时不敢分心，编织一条通向奇点的道路很困难。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "哪怕有特蕾西娅小姐的协助......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你看到了什么！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你看到了一个熟悉的身影。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不必分心，阿米娅。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "执行我们原本的计划。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "继续搭建这座“桥”！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "好！我正在努力稳定每一个连接点，博士。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "凯尔希医生之前搜索的每一项记录都被特蕾西娅小姐标记出来，我正试图将它们串联起来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但我还需要一个锚点，一个能够指引我返回的锚点——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魔王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我会于此守望，我会成为你的锚点。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "魔王",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "继续前进吧，阿米娅。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "粉色丝线开始聚集。\n蜿蜒的线条交织盘旋，逐渐从边界开始向更远处延伸。\n超越边界，通往奇点的通路正逐渐形成。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "成功了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "虽然源石技艺在这里似乎并不奏效，但是借用源石技艺的施术逻辑重构这里出现的信息是可行的！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你可以做到调用完全未知的信息搭建“桥”？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不行，这里充斥着我无法解析，甚至连“文明的存续”都无法替我转译的信息，完全依靠我自己无法构建通路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "但好在凯尔希医生的访问留下了记录，她的研究数据在特蕾西娅小姐的协助下能够被我捕捉到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这就足够了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "粉色丝线缓慢地盘旋串联起诸多庞杂的数据，那是凯尔希留下的足迹。\n由一丝到千丝万缕，道路正逐渐浮现。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "构建通路的效率不高，但应该能奏效。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我想尝试进入通路，尝试向奇点靠近。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我陪你一起。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不，博士，我不会允许你在我尚未探明情况的前提下贸然进入通路。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "原谅我的坚持，但这就是我的决定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "千丝万缕的信息所构建的通路已经远远延伸到了奇点。\n阿米娅毫不犹豫地踏上了通路，她第一次涉足了边界之外——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "浪涌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这种感觉，就好像这些信息形成了实质的浪涌一样，怎么会——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "恐怕这只是开始。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "“越靠近奇点，信息的密度会越高”......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "果然如特蕾西娅小姐所言，这里的信息已经足以产生质量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "继续深入应该会受到更大的阻碍。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅，先撤回来。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们需要考虑更好的应对方法。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我没法保证稳定住这条脆弱的通路，深入其中的消耗远比我预期的要更大。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我必须继续向前，只要沿着凯尔希医生留下的那些信标......"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "提卡兹走入的银色山脉从她的身边掠过，坠入冰原的巨兽投下的漆黑阴影转瞬即逝。\n阿米娅所看到的画面仍在快速从她的身边掠过，仿佛她正逆向蹚着时间的河流向前。\n越来越多她无法理解，无法描述的画面冲击着她的思维。\n她努力屏蔽那些无边无际却又混乱不堪的信息。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "集中注意力，集中注意力，只需要注视着凯尔希医生留下的信标......前进......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "只要能触碰到奇点——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "无声的寂静。\n阿米娅甚至无法听到自己呼吸的声音。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——？！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "这是......什么地方？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "那个巨大的球体......在碎裂？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "崩解的球体让她感到眩目，而那艘飘浮在空中的奇异形状的舰船更是让她恍了恍神。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "到底......发生了什么？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "为什么我会看到——"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "而就在她恍神之际，一颗转动的巨石以一种缓慢却不可阻挡的趋势向阿米娅逼近。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑色的阴影迅速遮挡了阿米娅的全部视线，她下意识地试图保护自己，但随即而来的却是无法控制的坠落感。\n失败了吗......是信息的浪涌吗？\n“阿米娅！”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......博士......？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我在。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "阿米娅感觉到有一只手扶住了自己，支撑着自己的思维保持稳定。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "试着屏蔽那些干扰我们的信息。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我和你一起。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "希望我来得不算晚。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "抱歉没能乖乖听你的话，阿米娅。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士......太好了......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "刚刚那一瞬间......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你竭力支撑阿米娅摇晃的身体，自奇点喷发而出的信息浪涌依旧不断冲击着你们。\n近乎形成实体的信息冲刷过你们的思维，在虚空中留下了混杂不清的残影——\n那是已然逝去的过去，是被庞大信息记录的当下，也似乎是预知了你们下一步行动的未来。\n可惜眼下，你们并没有多余的精力再去关注这些。\n从这里回望边界，你们已经不知不觉在通路上前行了很远，而奇点......\n奇点近在眼前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "博士，你看到刚才那个恐怖的景象了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "看到了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我无法分辨其中的含义。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我十分肯定那不是发生在泰拉的景象......"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "但至少这意味着我们的确正在接近奇点。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "更多的信息正在向我们开放。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你还能坚持吗，阿米娅？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "当，当然。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你很清楚你们如今的处境，尽管你知道这样可能收效甚微，但你还是下意识地伸出手，试图挡在阿米娅的前面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这里的冲击更多针对思维，我能应付。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我走前面。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "关于我们要找的关键，我有了线索。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我收集并演算了凯尔希留下的访问记录。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "直接从我的思维里读取关键信息。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "找到了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "以关键词“安眠桥”为筛选条件，凯尔希医生进行了共计七万九千三百四十六次检索......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "虽然所有的检索都与“源石”有关，但按照博士你的推测，这些数据都与源石的本质并无太大关联。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "如果结果都是拒绝访问而毫无收获，线索岂不是完全中断了？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "并非如此。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "凯尔希会重复检索同一个条目多次。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这本身就是在向我们传递某种信息。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "重复检索？等等，重复的检索次数组成的无限循环的代码也能够被解密？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......博士，你已经解出了答案。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "是的，一个熟悉的名字。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "或许是一个指示......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "或许是一个警告......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我从未听说过这个名字，无论是你还是凯尔希医生，都从来没有说起过——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "“普瑞赛斯”？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "——博士，我们看到的是同一个画面吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......恐怕，是的......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "“普瑞赛斯......”\n你从未见过这个画面，更没有见过——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）你来了，{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "那是......？",
          "value": "1",
