        },
        {
          "label": "“我”......？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "预言家",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）改进你设计出来的PRTS花了点时间。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "预言家",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）我以为你去休息了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）不，我一直在想你刚刚说的话。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）“不存在描述神的语言，因为神本身的存在是绝对不可理解的。”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "预言家",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）你很清楚那只是我们漫无目的聊天时的随口之言。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）如果我假设这是一个正确的前提。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（未知语言）以此为出发点，创造一种足够描述神的语言，是否也意味着神能够被我们理解？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "普瑞赛斯",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
